<title>SWITZERLAND: Maag sells units to Textron.</title>
<headline>Maag sells units to Textron.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's Maag Holding AG said it had signed an agreement with Textron Inc of Providence, RI, to sell its Maag Pump Systems AG (MPS) and Maag Italia SpA.</p>
<p>Maag said in a statement that the two companies had agreed not to disclose the sales price.</p>
</text>
